Third-Party Weights & Software Notice

1. AlphaFold 3:
   `af3-hall` does not bundle or redistribute AlphaFold 3 source code or model
   parameters. To run real structure predictions (`--backend in_memory` or
   `--backend subprocess`), users must separately obtain AlphaFold 3 and its
   model weights from Google DeepMind and comply with Google DeepMind's
   AlphaFold 3 Model Parameters Terms of Use and source code license.

2. ProteinMPNN / LigandMPNN (optional):
   Optional sequence proposal backends (`--mutation-method mpnn` or
   `ligand_mpnn_biased`) integrate with external ProteinMPNN / LigandMPNN
   repositories and checkpoints, which are governed by their respective
   open-source licenses and are not bundled in this repository.
